            <ab xml:id="MP2100_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʿL yẕdʾnʾḇydʾṭ' bwlcʾṭr' .[]....[]... ...
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ʾwhrmẕd mʾẕdysnyh mylkyh nc dʾšṭ'
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>wyhbwṭ' W ʾp̄ʾryk ʾNŠWṬʾ Y pṭ' šṭr'
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ŠRM W drwdsṭyh W KRʾ pl(h)[wyh]hmʾy
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>pṭ' LKWM YḤWWNʾṭ W pṭ.[](L)KWM
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>pṭ' drwdsṭyh W lʾmšn' ... ...
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>cygwn' ZK Y dšn' LK MRYʾ LKWM
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>lʾd pṭ' KRʾ wṭ wš[ʾṭ'     ](ḆYN)
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ʾp̄ʾyṭ pṭ'-c ZNH p...ṭ[].... ʾy
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>YḤWWNyt MH ʾNŠWṬʾ Y pṭ' šṭr'
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>drwdsṭ' ḤWHnd nʾmk' W dʾšn Y L MRʿḤ
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>lʾd MN šṭr' YḤYṬYWNṭ ... [   ]...[]BRʾ
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>ŠDRWNyṭ MH-m MN bwlck' ʿŠMH'ṭ
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/>ʾYḴ-ṭ glṭk' ḤṬYMWNṭ W BRʾ YCBNHyṭ
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trl-p1-l15"/>YʾṬWNṭn ZK Y mylkyh lʾd .[
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trl-p1-l16"/>LKWM ḆYN ʾp̄ʾyṭ ʾy Y[ʾṬWN]ynd ḤṬ
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trl-p1-l17"/>LKWM lʾd ʾp̄ʾyṭ Y BYRḤ ʾṭwr W nkʾs
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trl-p1-l18"/>ʾy YḤSNNynd W MN nʾmk' Y wšʾṭ'krṭ'
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trl-p1-l19"/>kʾln(?) ʾṭhš ʾy ʿḆYDWNynd LK lʾd
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trl-p1-l20"/>hwp' krṭ' ʾMṬ-m pṭ' [].[].[
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trl-p1-l21"/>pṭgʾm ŠDRWNyṭ ʾYḴ LK[W]M LṬMH
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trl-p1-l22"/>BRʾ ʾy YʾṬWNyṭ ...[]... dʾšn' .[
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trl-p1-l23"/>BRʾ ʿL ʾMYṭl ŠDRWNyṭ m[] pṭ' ...[
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trl-p1-l24"/>... ... gl-... nʾm(k)['?   ].[
               <lb n="25" xml:id="trl-p1-l25"/>pṭ' YDH LʿYṬ' W lʾs(?) LK y/d-[].[
               <lb n="26" xml:id="trl-p1-l26"/>ʾP̱-ṭ lʾd MNDʿM (ʾy) ŠDRWNyṭ[
               <lb n="27" xml:id="trl-p1-l27"/>ŠDRWNʾṭ drwdsṭ(yh) Y LK[WM(?)] lʾd[
               <lb n="28" xml:id="trl-p1-l28"/>nʾmk' ʿḆYDWN(m)(?) ... ...[
               <lb n="29" xml:id="trl-p1-l29"/>B... ... lʾd ....[].... nʾmk' .[
               <lb n="30" xml:id="trl-p1-l30"/>BYRḤ ʾṭwr m[]....[]...[
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP2100_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>ō yazdān-ayād Burz-ādur .[].... ]... ...
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>Ōhrmazd māzdēsnīh mēragīh namāz dāšt
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>Wehbūd ud abārīg mardom ī pad šahr
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>drōd ud drustīh ud harw farrox[īh] hamē
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>pad ašmā bawād ud p... ... ašmā
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>pad drustīh ud rāmišn ... ...
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>čiyōn ān ī dašn tō saxwan ašmā
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>rāy pad harw wad wi[šād] (andar)
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>abāyēd pad-iz im p....[].... ē
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>bawēd čē mardom ī pad šahr
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>drust hēnd nāmag ud dāšn ī man xwadāy
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>rāy az šahr āwurd ... []... []bē
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>frēstēd čē-m az Burzag āšnūd
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>ku-t girdag awišt ud bē kāmēd
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/>āmadan ān ī mēragīh rāy .[
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trc-p1-l16"/>as̄mā andar abāyēd ē ā(y)ēnd agar
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trc-p1-l17"/>ašmā rāy abāyēd ī māh ^ādur ud nigāh
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trc-p1-l18"/>ē dārēnd ud az nāmag ī wišād kard
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trc-p1-l19"/>kārān(?) ātaxš ē kunēnd tō rāy
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trc-p1-l20"/>xūb kard ka-m pad [
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trc-p1-l21"/>paygām frēstīd ku aš[m]ā ēdar
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trc-p1-l22"/>bē ē āyēd ....[]... dāšn .[
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trc-p1-l23"/>bē ō mādar frēstīd m[] pad ....[
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trc-p1-l24"/>... ... ... nāmag(?)[
               <lb n="25" xml:id="trc-p1-l25"/>pad dast nēst ud rāh(?) tō .[].[
               <lb n="26" xml:id="trc-p1-l26"/>u-t rāy tis (ē) frēstēd[
               <lb n="27" xml:id="trc-p1-l27"/>frēstād drustīh ī aš[mā? ] rāy[
               <lb n="28" xml:id="trc-p1-l28"/>nāmag ud kunēm? ... ...[
               <lb n="29" xml:id="trc-p1-l29"/>... ... rāy ....[].... nāmag .[
               <lb n="30" xml:id="trc-p1-l30"/>māh Ādur .[]....[]... [
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP2100_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>To Burz-Ādur, remembered by (the) god(s) ... (of)
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>marriage according to the Mazdean rite: reverence! Received
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>by Wehbūd and the other people in town
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>well-being and health and all fortune
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>over you (pl.) (may) be and ...
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>in health and peace...
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>like your (sg.) right word on your (pl.)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>behalf every bad [be dispersed]
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>it is necessary, on this ..., too, ... it
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>should be becasue people in town
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>are in health. My letter and fit
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>for you (sg.) he(?) brought from (the) town ...
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trans-p1-l13"/>For I learnt from Burzag
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trans-p1-l14"/>that you sealed the bundle and he wants
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trans-p1-l15"/>to come because of the young husband-ship.
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trans-p1-l16"/>They would come if
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trans-p1-l17"/>it is fitting for you (pl.) of month Ādur and
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trans-p1-l18"/>they would watch and from the letter which had been opened
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trans-p1-l19"/>(other) people(?) would make a fire, for you (sg.)
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trans-p1-l20"/>it was made well. When I by ... ...
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trans-p1-l21"/>sent a message that you (pl.) hither
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trans-p1-l22"/>should come ... ... gift ...
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trans-p1-l23"/>to the mother was sent
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trans-p1-l24"/>... ... letter(?) ...
               <lb n="25" xml:id="trans-p1-l25"/>in the hand there is not and the road(?) you(sg.)(?) [...]
               <lb n="26" xml:id="trans-p1-l26"/>and on your (sg.) behalf something he should send [...]
               <lb n="27" xml:id="trans-p1-l27"/>he will send, because of your (pl.) health
               <lb n="28" xml:id="trans-p1-l28"/>I write the letter ... ...
               <lb n="29" xml:id="trans-p1-l29"/>... ... letter ...
               <lb n="30" xml:id="trans-p1-l30"/>month Ādur ... …
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>